referred to us, no matter how fantastical,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:27.360
no matter how absurd, and took every&nbsp;
one of those seriously, including these.&nbsp;

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:32.480
Speaker 1: So it's not that they say,&nbsp;
well, you have to investigate all of it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

